{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "feaf601442696cd7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "March 26. The martyrdom of Saint Irenaeus... When a good character grows together with piety,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "5f883927ed2f1b93",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "it desires greater things and receives the fear of God. Then, despising everything in this life,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "5dc5e34e495d3ed4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "it strives to receive the promised blessings, so that, seeing with firm faith the things heard of as though they were already present, it may long for them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "715a42b259447a38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then, having received these things through God's glory, it glorifies the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "6edc41163a63305d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This also happened in the case of blessed Irenaeus, bishop of the city of Sirmium."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "dc9eb2cf4593c3b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Through his great gentleness and his reverence for God, he confirmed by his deeds what has been said."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "8fd58cd192ba7ea7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For when the persecution came that took place under the emperors Diocletian and Maximian,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "f16ac3f412eb845c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Saint Irenaeus was brought before the governor Probus and was asked whether he wished to sacrifice to the gods."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "fa06885a28bd0972",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Blessed Irenaeus answered, saying, “I do not even wish to live with you.” Then the governor ordered him to be shut up in prison."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "5876f82af509b1a5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "After many days had passed while he was in prison, the governor came at midnight."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "4b402df7df9344f8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Blessed Irenaeus was brought out again, and after enduring various tortures, he was asked, “Why do you not sacrifice?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.126v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "dfdd5520116cafef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He answered, saying, “Because I have a God whom I have learned to honor from my youth, and the so-called"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "67e7675672a50829",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "gods of yours I will not worship.” Probus said, “Secure your life for yourself. The abuse you have suffered is enough for you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "0eb5358800c4db42",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Saint Irenaeus said, “I will not gain death when life lies before me,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "2df0efd474e7602f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but rather receive life from God.” Probus said, “Do you have a wife?” He answered, “I do not.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "50895ae9157cfe10",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Blessed Irenaeus said this in fulfillment of the Lord's commandment, which says:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "00157c3b3510bca9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "“Whoever loves father or mother, or brothers, or wife, or children more than me is not worthy of me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "bbbffb93cb82591b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Keeping this commandment in view, the blessed man had his mind fixed on heaven, desiring to see the glory of the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "0b1bbe444e1f11ba",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And having left behind all human life, he declared that he knew and possessed nothing more precious than the Lord."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "06bd98c97752eac6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then the governor said to him again, “I know that you have sons. Sacrifice at least for their sake.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "a5ca23a629cc2e6d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But he answered, “My sons have God, just as I do,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "41bdbf2bf7e761a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and he can care for them. But you, do what you have been ordered to do.” Probus said, “I advise you, young man, to sacrifice,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "6b1a2a73aa948f8b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that I do not hand you over to various tortures.” The holy martyr Irenaeus said, “I will not sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "e1ece35e94ec09e0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do whatever you wish. For you will learn that through the power of Christ I will bravely endure everything.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "0be19e7f0b73e336",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Probus said, “Since you refuse to obey the emperor, you will be thrown into the river.” Irenaeus said, “You, with various tortures"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "203638941adfe637",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "You threatened to kill me, and I hoped that you would cut off my head with a sword."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "77f5a84bbb5bd8a7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "Therefore I beg you, command that this be done, so that you may know how we Christians have learned to despise death"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "bafe962e118237aa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "for the love of Christ. But the governor, angered by the boldness of the holy martyr Irenaeus,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "24147e68a9b7c2e1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "ordered him to be beheaded with a sword. But the holy martyr,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "1e8160bab913a17b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "as though he had received a second crown, said, “I give thanks to my God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "035ead1ae3d5f10c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "who has granted me the crown for enduring various tortures.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "46d8d9ec81cee890",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "And when they had crossed the bridge called Artemis, he took off his clothes"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "6534a822ecdb6180",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "and, looking up to heaven, prayed, saying, “Lord, let the heavens be opened"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "ca6ab85fb12132a2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "and let them receive the soul of your servant, just as they do for your people of the universal Church"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "a96eb48726b7dc46",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "and its entire congregation. Believing in you, Lord Jesus Christ, I suffer all this.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "cd34302408700293",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "And after beheading him, they threw him into the river. This happened in Sirmium,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "c1aa820f93b3bcdb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "when Probus was governor, while Jesus Christ our Lord reigns forever."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/passio-irenaei#Supr.127v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "840a9d4711ba91d8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 13,
      "text": "To him be glory, now and always and forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
